.TH ADJTIMEX 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
adjtimex \- queries or adjusts the system clock using the linux x86-64 timex layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/timex.h>
.B int adjtimex(struct timex* state);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queries or adjusts the system clock using the Linux x86-64 timex layout. A zero modes field performs a query; modifications generally require privilege.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR adjtimex (2)
